WEBVTT

00:32:57.538 --> 00:33:01.621
He did something where I was like,
I wonder if he's maybe magical.

00:33:01.663 --> 00:33:07.579
Does he have? And my whole point is
the fact that someone who's a half

00:33:07.579 --> 00:33:11.163
a century old can still have
a moment of thinking.

00:33:11.579 --> 00:33:16.413
There might be powers beyond that,
which I know is so profound.

00:33:16.413 --> 00:33:22.204
And the the wow and the gasping and the
amazement that any audience has,

00:33:22.454 --> 00:33:27.829
big or small, it's there's something about
the the sense of possibility that

00:33:27.829 --> 00:33:30.329
the world is more than it seems